  "statement": "Let \\(T\\) be a right triangle with sides having lengths 3,4 , and 5 . A point \\(P\\) is called awesome if \\(P\\) is the center of a parallelogram whose vertices all lie on the boundary of \\(T\\). What is the area of the set of awesome points?",
  "answerChoices": [],
